        "name": "Head Rush",
        "description": "Briar leaps to a unit and hits enemies with The Heel Wheel (of Pain), stunning them and breaking their Armor.",
        "tooltip": "Briar leaps to a target, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> it for 0.85 seconds, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/85/110/135/160 + (60% Ability Power) + (80% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and reducing 10/12.5/15/17.5/20% <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span> for 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Briar will stop prioritizing champions if she casts this Ability on a minion or monster during <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blood Frenzy</span>.</span><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability applies <span>On-Hit</span> effects.</span>",
