      {
        "id": "BriarE",
        "name": "Chilling Scream",
        "description": "Briar refocuses her mind, removing Blood Frenzy and channeling energy into a powerful scream that damages and slows enemies. While charging, she takes reduced damage and heals for a portion of her max Health. A fully charged scream knocks foes back, dealing additional damage and stunning those who collide with a wall.",
        "tooltip": "<span>Begin Charging:</span> Briar removes <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blood Frenzy</span> and gathers energy, gaining 35% damage reduction and restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(10/11.5/13/14.5/16% Health) Health</span> over 1 second.<br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Briar unleashes a scream that deals up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/115/150/185/220 + (100% bonus Attack Damage) + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> based on time charged, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 80% for 0.5 seconds. When fully charged, the scream <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Back</span> enemies, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(140/215/290/365/440 + (240% bonus Attack Damage) + (240% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to those who hit a wall and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> them for 1.5 seconds.",
