      {
        "id": "BriarR",
        "name": "Certain Death",
        "description": "Briar kicks her pillory's hemolith gemstone, marking the first champion it hits as her prey. She then beelines straight to them, fearing other surrounding enemies upon arriving at her target, and enters a state of complete hemomania. She will pursue her prey until death, gaining the benefits of Blood Frenzy as well as additional Armor, Magic Resistance, Life Steal, and Move Speed.",
        "tooltip": "Briar kicks her pillory's hemolith gemstone and flies to the location of the first champion it hits, marking them as her prey. On landing, she deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (130% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to everything nearby and causes enemies who are not her prey to <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Flee</span> for 1.5 seconds. She then enters an empowered <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Blood Frenzy</span> and will pursue her prey until death. During this time, she gains (20% Attack Damage) <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">Armor</span> and <span>Magic Resist</span>, 10/15/20% Lifesteal, and an additional <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">10/20/30% Move Speed</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">When the hemolith hits it interrupts channeled Abilities. Briar has <span style=\"color: #ee91d7\">True Sight</font color> of her prey.</span>",
